    "modid": "attachments_api",
    "modName": "AttachmentsAPI",
    "version": "1.0.1",
    "description": "Allows registration of saved, synched custom data on any entity using a simple event, attachments can also be setup to allow changing from only serverside or only clientside but by default can be set by client or server",
